- _reg_url = new_user_registration_url(email: @invite.email)

%h2="#{@user.username} has invited you to Nitrous.IO to code on #{@box_template.name}"

%p Nitrous.IO provides a lightning fast way to setup and manage development environments in the cloud.

%p Click the link below to sign up and start coding with #{@user.username} on #{@box_template.name}

%p= link_to _reg_url, _reg_url

%p Want some more reasons why you should sign up?

%ul
  %li Get starter resources for free!
  %li Our Web IDE allows you to code from anywhere
  %li Support for Ruby/Rails, Python/Django, Node.JS and Go
  %li Invite collaborators to your box to code together in real-time

%p
  The Nitrous.IO Team
  %br
  = link_to "https://www.nitrous.io/", "https://www.nitrous.io/"

%p
  P.S. We are
  = link_to('hiring in San Francisco!', jobs_url)

= mixpanel_pixel_track 'Collaboration Invite Received', @invite.email

